          "filename": "070430 BM1 Culbertson Memorial.jpg",
          "caption": "On April 30, 2007 a small group gathered at the Duluth Entry to honor and remember the life of BM1 Edgar Culbertson.  Friend and retired Captain Tom Mackay placed an iris on the memorial plaque for each life lost that day to the Great Duluth Storm of April 30, 1967.  BM1 Edgar Culbertson and three young brothers were all lost to the sea during the horrific storm.",
